Z||000000||pherder||08-09-2000||06:04 PM||||Just received my Oct 00 issue of Kit Car Magazine and in the Kit Cartoons by Jerry Workman ... <P>It shows a Ferrari convertible with the owner talking to his passenger ...<P>"Right now it's just your run-of-the-mill original Ferrari.  But with another couple hundred hours of work and 10-to-15 grand, I'll have it converted into a very sweet Fiero."<P>FDOTFLMAO!!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Paul||||reg||6
