Z||000002||pherder||08-09-2000||09:05 PM||||Jon,<P>As an ex-owner of a Ferrari 308 kit, I have actually heard a Ferrari 308 owner tell me something similar!  I had placed (trophied) at a Rod & Custom show with my 308 and he did not with his.  He came over after the show and told me (and my kit car group that I was with) that he figured how to win a trophy at one of these shows ... put a Fiero engine in his Ferrari!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>He might have been right!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Paul<BR>86 GT made into a Ferrari 308 ... seen in May 96 issue of Kit Car magazine. (my 15 minutes of fame!)||||reg||12
